    solutionSteps: ["[1 mark] Greatest cards per page = HCF(54, 72, 63). By prime factorization: 54 = 2 x 3^3, 72 = 2^3 x 3^2, 63 = 3^2 x 7.", "[1 mark] HCF = lowest power of the common prime = 3^2 = 9. So 9 cards per page.", "[1 mark] Pages: football 54/9 = 6 pages, volleyball 72/9 = 8 pages, basketball 63/9 = 7 pages."],
