    solutionSteps: ["[1 mark] Each row's length must be a common multiple of 10, 12 and 15, so the shortest length = LCM(10, 12, 15).", "[1 mark] By prime factorization: 10 = 2 x 5, 12 = 2^2 x 3, 15 = 3 x 5.", "[1 mark] LCM = 2^2 x 3 x 5 = 60. So the shortest length is 60 inches."],
