    solutionSteps: ["[1 mark] The planets realign after LCM(3, 7, 12) months.", "[1 mark] By prime factorization: 3 = 3, 7 = 7, 12 = 2^2 x 3.", "[1 mark] LCM = 2^2 x 3 x 7 = 84. So the minimum is 84 months (i.e. 7 years)."],
