    solutionSteps: ["[1 mark] Let x = ml of 50% solution, y = ml of 80% solution. Total volume: x + y = 100.", "[1 mark] Acid content: 0.50x + 0.80y = 0.68 * 100 = 68.", "[1 mark] From the first equation y = 100 - x. Substitute: 0.50x + 0.80(100 - x) = 68.", "[1 mark] 0.50x + 80 - 0.80x = 68 => -0.30x = -12 => x = 40 ml of 50% solution.", "[1 mark] y = 100 - 40 = 60 ml of 80% solution."],
